      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "4.与瑞娜的父亲（70.81）对话，选“否”交出【项链的情报】获得【巧克力】。",
