        8
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "5.与罗伯尼克博士（59.78）对话，交出【巧克力】获得【金属探测仪】。",
