        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "6.队伍中一人与小岛上的酒吧老板（55.81）处交出10000G购买一个【星鳗饭团】；也可向玩家购买。",
      "type": "purchase-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        10
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "7.队伍中一人持有【星鳗饭团】与觅食的水龙蜥（82.20）对话，交出【星鳗饭团】，全队进入达尔文海海底。",
      "type": "party-exchange-teleport",
      "sourceLines": [
        11
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "8.通过随机迷宫进入深海秘窟，与深海领主对话进入战斗。",
      "type": "maze-battle-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        12
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "9.战斗胜利后与深海领主对话，交出【金属探测仪】获得【机器零件】并传送回小岛。",
      "type": "post-battle-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        13
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "10.与罗伯尼克博士（59.78）对话，交出【机器零件】获得【博士的腕轮】，任务完结。",
      "type": "completion-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        14
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "◆拥有称号“背叛者”、“地狱的回响”或“死神的降临”时，第2~3步可跳过；",
      "type": "shortcut-gate",
      "sourceLines": [
        15
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "前往法兰城西门外与阿鲁卡（398.168）对话，交出800G可传送至小岛",
      "type": "shortcut-teleport",
      "sourceLines": [
        16
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "①称号“背叛者”获得方式参考《小岛之谜》半山5任务；",
      "type": "title-source",
      "sourceLines": [
        17
